<view class="collections-page"><view class="collections-head"><view class="kicker">MY NOTES</view><view class="title">我的收藏</view><view class="desc">把想去的地方先收进来。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在整理收藏…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!posts.length}}" class="state"><view class="empty-mark">♡</view><text>还没有收藏内容</text><text class="muted">在社区看到喜欢的笔记，点一下收藏。</text></view><view wx:else class="saved-list"><view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="postId" class="saved-item" data-id="{{item.postId}}" bindtap="openPost"><image src="{{item.imageUrls[0] || '/assets/covers/box1.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="saved-copy"><view class="saved-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="saved-desc">{{item.content}}</view><view class="saved-meta">{{item.author.nickname}} · ♡ {{item.likeCount}}</view></view></view></view></view>

<tuge-overlay />
